card: Apache-2.0) and aligned rows from rikka-snow/prompt-injection-multilingual
(dataset card: MIT). The package contains hashed features and numerical parameters,
not the source texts. The intent lessons and office exam were authored for this project.
See research/README.md for upstream authors, pinned revisions and evaluation-only sources.

The terminal interface is inspired by Hugging Face's PyBot. PyJev is not a PyBot fork
or an official Hugging Face or Jev product. No third-party chatbot code is included.
